column10:
About
L.A. Girl Glide Gel Eyeliner Pencil Whiten 1.2g is an eyeliner with a gel texture perfect for you to effortlessly highlight your eyes. That said, this pencil has an extremely pigmented color that glides on effortlessly on your eyelids. On the other hand, you don't need to be a makeup artist to make your looks perfect as with this eyeliner you can get the defined, bold look only a gel eyeliner can give. Furthermore, through its sharpening tip you can easily create fine lines or even a smokey look. For the latter, just blend out the eyeliner immediately after application. On the other hand, then you just let your design dry and that's it, it will last on your skin all day long! All in all, this pigmented eyeliner allows you to style your eyes so they are always the center of attention.
Characteristics
Color family: white;
Color payoff: intense;
Texture: gel;
Good for: enhance the eye makeup look;
Waterproof: no;
Longevity: long-lasting;
Presentation: pencil;
Formulated without: ingredients of animal origin, parabens, fragrance.
Color family: white;
Color payoff: intense;
Texture: gel;
Good for: enhance the eye makeup look;
Waterproof: no;
Longevity: long-lasting;
Presentation: pencil;
Formulated without: ingredients of animal origin, parabens, fragrance.
Main Ingredients
Isododecane provides a non-oily light skin feel while making the eyeliner long-lasting;
Carnauba wax contributes to form a skin-protective film;
Dimethicone provides a smooth feel, at the same time helping to form a skin-protective film
How to use
Apply L.A. Girl Glide Gel Eyeliner Pencil Whiten 1.2g by drawing a line from the inner to outer corner of eyelid. Glide the pencil from inner corner to outer corner of the eye, keeping the pencil close to the lash line. For a smudged-out look, use the appropriate brush and blend out the liner before it sets. Sharpen as needed.
Apply L.A. Girl Glide Gel Eyeliner Pencil Whiten 1.2g by drawing a line from the inner to outer corner of eyelid. Glide the pencil from inner corner to outer corner of the eye, keeping the pencil close to the lash line. For a smudged-out look, use the appropriate brush and blend out the liner before it sets. Sharpen as needed.
ISODODECANE, SYNTHETIC WAX, HYDROGENATED POLYDICYCLOPENTADIENE, PEG/PPG-18/18 DIMETHICONE, POLYBUTENE, GLYCERYL TRIBEHENATE/ISOSTEARATE/EICOSANDIOATE, NYLON-12, POLYETHYLENE, PERFLUORONONYL DIMETHICONE, POLYGLYCERYL-4 DIISOSTEARATE/POLYHYDROXYSTEARATE/SEBACATE, SYNTHETIC BEESWAX, PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRA-DI-T-BUTYL HYDROXYHYDROCINNAMATE, COPERNICIA CERIFERA (CARNAUBA) WAX. MAY CONTAIN/PEUT CONTENIR : [+/: MICA (CI 77019), IRON OXIDES (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), FERRIC AMMONIUM FERROCYANIDE (CI 77510), TITANIUM DIOXIDE (CI 77891), YELLOW 5 LAKE (CI 19140), BLUE 1 LAKE (CI 42090), CHROMIUM HYDROXIDE GREEN (CI 77289).]

